  "job_B9.5.2_20251003_115017": {
    "chunk_text": "ine genam & forgeat, \u00fe\u00e6t heo hine mid Cristes rodetacne gebletsode, ac heo \u00dea wear\u00f0 heo sona fram deofle gegripen & ni\u00f0er on \u00fea eor\u00f0an gefeoll & w\u00e6s swi\u00fee geswenced. & hi \u00fea hr\u00e6dlice to heora f\u00e6der Equito \u00e6rendracan s\u00e6ndon & him \u00feis s\u00e6don & hine b\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t he & \u00fea he halga man gebiddende arn. & sona swa se halga f\u00e6der in \u00feone wyrtun ineode, \u00fea ongan se deofol, \u00fee \u00fea nunnan swencte, of Hw\u00e6t dyde ic hire? Ic me s\u00e6t on anum leahtrice, \u00fea com heo & bat me. He \u00fea se Godes wer mid mycelre \u00e6bylignysse bebead, \u00fe\u00e6t he of hire gewite, & \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea stowe & he \u00fea sona onweg gewat, & he na onufan \u00fe\u00e6t hire gehrinan ne moste ne ne dorste. Sume d\u00e6ge hit gelamp, \u00fe\u00e6t Felix, se w\u00e6s \u00e6\u00feele f\u00e6der Nursine \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e & hlaford \u00feisses \u00dea \u00fea he geacsode, \u00fe\u00e6t se arwur\u00f0a wer n\u00e6fde \u00feone halgan had, \u00fee Godes folces lareowas habban Ne \u00feu \u00feone halgan had n\u00e6fst, ne \u00feu nane leafe ne onfengce \u00e6t \u00feam Romaniscan biscope, \u00fee \u00feu \u00d0a w\u00e6s se halga wer Equitius mid \u00fe\u00e6re acsunge ge\u00feread & genyded, & he \u00fea him secgan ongan, Ac sumere niht hit gelamp, \u00fe\u00e6t me sum geong man \u00e6t gestod, se w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e f\u00e6ggerre ansyne, & Ac gang \u00feu & boda. \u00d0a \u00e6fter \u00feam d\u00e6ge, \u00feeh",
